{"type":"corollary","type_name":"Corollary","number":"3.3.5","title":"Transcendental Numbers Exist","title_html":"Transcendental Numbers Exist","html":"<p>The set <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R} \\setminus\n\\mathrm{Alg}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2216\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c41\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">Alg</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> of transcendental numbers is uncountable. In\nparticular, there is a real number that is not algebraic.</p>","file":"ch3/diagonal-arguments.html"}